  "releaseNotes": "Fix: Blazor WebAssembly DocBook XSLT regression (Martin Honnen 2026-06-01). Two related issues prevented DocBook TNG pipelines from running under WASM: the XQuery-side fn:transform provider (XsltTransformProvider) bypassed PreloadedResources and tried synchronous HTTP fetch (FOXT0001); and the HttpImportPreloader walker only seeded URLs from doc()/document() calls, missing DocBook's fn:transform(map{'stylesheet-location':'http://...'}) pipeline pattern. Both fixed.\n      See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
